        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a service to the vehicle seller, we will customarily pay advance charges (reimbursable charges paid on behalf of vehicle sellers) to obtain the vehicle’s release from a towing company, vehicle repair facility, or impound facility.",
        "start_character": 16667,
        "end_character": 16900
      },
      {
