        "filing_date": "2025-09-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Generally, sellers of non-salvage vehicles will arrange to deliver the vehicle to one of our locations, although we may offer transportation services to obtain the vehicle.",
